<section class="uo-page-hero">
  <div class="uo-wrap">
    <span class="uo-eyebrow">OUR PHILOSOPHY</span>
    <h1 class="uo-heading-serif uo-page-hero-title">A Better Night Begins With Better Design.</h1>
    <p class="uo-page-hero-desc">
      We created ULTRA OVERNIGHT™ to solve the anxiety, sheet staining, and sleep disruptions women face during their heaviest nights.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="uo-page-content-wrap">
  <div class="uo-wrap">
    <!-- Story Block 1 -->
    <div class="uo-about-grid">
      <div class="uo-about-text">
        <h3 class="uo-heading-serif">Protection Designed Beyond Ordinary Gussets</h3>
        <p>
          Most conventional period underwear simply places a rectangular absorbent pad right at the center bottom. But when you lie down, gravity pulls fluid backwards or sideways depending on how you sleep.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our Full-Spine™ architecture extends continuous protective coverage from the front pelvis all the way to the top rear waistband. Whether you sleep on your back, curled on your side, or change positions throughout the night, our multi-layer design is engineered to help keep you protected and confident.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="uo-about-media">
        <img src="{{ 'ultra-lifestyle-card-2.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Full-Spine Protection Concept" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Story Block 2 -->
    <div class="uo-about-grid" style="margin-bottom:0;">
      <div class="uo-about-media">
        <img src="{{ 'ultra-lifestyle-card-3.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Cloud-Like Fabric Texture" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="uo-about-text">
        <h3 class="uo-heading-serif">Sensory Comfort Meets High-Capacity Science</h3>
        <p>
          Nobody wants to sleep in stiff, crinkly plastic or bulky diaper-like layers. We spent months perfecting the NOCTÉRA-5™ layered system: pairing moisture-wicking micro-mesh, rapid diffusion cores, and breathable waterproof barriers with butter-soft modal knits.
        </p>
        <p>
          The result is whisper-quiet, flexible bedtime comfort that lets your skin breathe while holding high-volume flow securely until morning.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

